      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Contract award criteria",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This regulation states that contracting authorities must base the award of public contracts on the most economically advantageous tender (MEAT) assessed from the point of view of the contracting authority. The regulation also sets out the rules relating to contract award criteria and how the MEAT should be determined.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Contract award criteria",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Contract award criteria",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Information provided by suppliers must be verified effectively for accuracy wherever the contracting authority has doubts as to its correctness.",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Contract award criteria",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Contract award criteria",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities should:",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Contract award criteria",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "ensure that effective verification is carried out wherever they have doubt in the accuracy of the information provided by suppliers.",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Contract award criteria",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
